        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isiraeli ekaba neshusha omuzabibu gugeizire oguraba. Okwo bakanyaga baba nikwo beyongera kwombeka alutare. Okwo ensi yabo yashemeraga bongera enyomyo z'okufukamira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ti bantu ba mazima; mbwenu baragiirwe kushasha aha rw'amafu gabo. Alutare zabo Omukama alizata, n'enyomyo zabo azisinjagure. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho nirwo baligamba bati, “Titwina mukama, kuba titulikutina Mukama Ruhanga. Isi n'orwo Omukama wenene twakubaire twinawe, yakutukoleireki?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibagamba ebigambo bushai, nibakora endagano nibarahira ebishuba. Kityo n'eiramu nibaramura elibi nk'orumbugu omu ndimiro elimire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanyansi ba Samaria nibachundwa aha rw'enyana ya Betiaveni. Abantu bamwo balichulira Samaria egyo, n'abakuhani bayo abalikufukamira ebihuuku baligichulira, balichulira n'ekitinwa kyayo eki ekigirugireho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ego, ekihuuku ekyo balikitwara Asiria, bakihongere Omukama Yarebu. Abaefuraimu balishonara, ekihuuku ekyo kilibakwasa enshoni. Abaisiraeli abo ekihuuku kyabo kilibashonaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama wa Samaria alisilika, alishusha ekishate ky'omuti ekilikweleera aha maizi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emyanya mikuru ya Aveni ey'okufukamiramu nayo elikambuka. Alutare zabo zilimerwa amahwa n'amatoju, kandi baligambira amabanga bati, “Mutusangire,” bagambire n'enshozi bati, “Mutugwere.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama nagamba ati, “Inywe Baisiraeli, kwema muli Gibea mutura nimufakara, timukalekeraga; kityo muligwerwa endashana nk'ey'abagweleire Gibea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu aba enyeleme ndibatabalira mbabonabonyie; kandi kabaliba baboine ekibonabonyio ekyo, amahanga galibahurulira gabature entambara zabo ezo bazigilira.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Efuraimu ashusha enyana y'enkiraiziba eyo bayegesize kulibata engano, nikwo nashazire ebikyabye ebirungi. Mbwenu Efuraimu ndimukoma enkomo omu ngoto, Yuda alime, kandi Yakobo ayetelere amasinde. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mubibe oburungi, mugeshe engonzi mahika. Mulime ensi yanyu eraragaine kuba aka niko kanya kanyu k'okumpiga, nyije mbarokore okw'obona enjura egwire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulimire entambara mwagesha okutakoza mazima, ebishuba nibyo biraba byomulikulya. Mukesiga amagali ganyu g'endashana n'abaisherukare banyu ekinje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'ekyo mulihindukana inywe nywenene mugire endashana, eboma zanyu zona zisilike nk'okwo Shalumani yasilikize Betiarabeli kiro ekyo endashana yabaho, banyina bana bakabakankabura ahansi n'abana babo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nainywe Baisiraeli nikwo balibagira batyo, muzire amafu ganyu ago agangi. Kandi omukama wa Isiraeli enkomaizi egyo elimutwalishanyia.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
